OL,3,ANo more washing up: How Airbnb's new
OL,4,Ahouse rules have divided hosts and
OL,5,Aguests
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Lisa Clewes returned to her Welsh
OL,8,Fholiday let after a group of guests
OL,9,Fchecked out, she was horrified by the
OL,10,Fmess.
OL,12,FJust days earlier, she had met the
OL,13,Fgroup in person and helped with their
OL,14,Fluggage.
OL,16,FBut after a dinner party, the house was
OL,17,Fleft "in a complete mess" with broken
OL,18,Fglasses, drinks cans on the floor, pans
OL,19,Ffull of food on the table and fish guts
OL,20,Fleft in the garden.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
