OL,3,ANo more washing up: How Airbnb's new
OL,4,Ahouse rules have divided hosts and
OL,5,Aguests
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It was really unbelievable. Had I had
OL,8,Fanother booking the same day, I would
OL,9,Fhave had to cancel or delay check-in,"
OL,10,Fsays Clewes.
